    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69579" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μώλωψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωπος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mark
				of a stripe, weal, bruise</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				200
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				889b10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				53.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				16.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.565b
			</span></i>, etc.; of an eruption resembling mosquito bites, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				5.129
			</span></i>; <i>blood-clot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.8
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορφύρεοι μώλωπες</span>,
			satirically of kings, Daphit. ap.<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.1.39
			</span></i>.</div>
